# Ambitious Augmenter: "if it had one or more counters on it" counts counters of any kind, not only +1/+1 counters (CR 603.4,
# 122.1). Bot1 casts Cryogen Relic before the Augmenter, so no increment counter; on turn 3 the attacking (tapped) Augmenter takes a
# stun counter from the Relic, then Lightning Bolt kills it. It had a counter, so the ability makes a Fractal token and puts the
# stun counter on it; the 0/0 Fractal then dies to state-based actions (CR 704.5f).

[Bot1 Deck]
Ambitious Augmenter
Mox Emerald
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Cryogen Relic
Lightning Bolt
Island x15

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Cryogen Relic.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Ambitious Augmenter.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ambitious Augmenter.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Attack(Ambitious Augmenter > Bot2)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Cryogen Relic.Activate(Bot1.Battlefield.Ambitious Augmenter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
? Bot1.Battlefield.Ambitious Augmenter.Counters.Stun = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Ambitious Augmenter)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Ambitious Augmenter; Lightning Bolt; Cryogen Relic
LeftBattlefield = Cryogen Relic; Ambitious Augmenter (tapped); Fractal Token
